  "description": "Application-security workflow for .NET MAUI on Android and iOS. Locks the app after it backgrounds, waits out a grace period, then unlocks with Face ID, Touch ID, fingerprint, or the device PIN. Not another biometric API — the lock timer, lifecycle, and RequireAuthenticationAsync gate are the product.",
